# Version

One version string for firmware, portal, and docs.

| Place | How |
| --- | --- |
| [`include/version.h`](include/version.h) | `kFirmwareVersion` (source of truth) |
| Web | `/status` field `ver`; portal footer `dmxwhip v…` |
| [`README.md`](README.md) | `Version:` line and **Version history** |

**PATCH** polish/bugfix. **MINOR** user-visible feature. **MAJOR** breaking on-wire or file-format change.

Bump all three in the same change. Add a README history line for why. Never skip a number. Do not change version without that note.
